@chapter SCI Frontend Language
@cindex SCI frontend language

This chapter describes the SCI (Sierra Creative Interpreter) frontend language as
implemented in the EightBol compiler. SCI provides a Lisp-based language for creating
sophisticated adventure games with object-oriented programming, classes, instances,
and method dispatch. The language is defined by its lexer (@file{sci-lexer.lisp})
and parser (@file{sci-parser.lisp}).

